<title>USA: BP Prudhoe Bay stake cut by Bass group.</title>
<headline>BP Prudhoe Bay stake cut by Bass group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Texas billionaire Robert Bass said Wednesday it reduced its stake in BP Prudhoe Bay Royalty Trust to 894,500 units of beneficial trust or 4.2 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 365,000 units between March 14 and March 25 at prices ranging from $15.66 to $16.30 per share.</p>
</text>
